    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed information on the specific requirements and scope of the project, I cannot provide a precise calculation of The global budget allocated to the project or a comprehensive list of cost-optimization strategies tailored to this contract." ;
