    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist agents in agents daily missions by facilitating access to information, improving the quality of answers, and reducing processing times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide a high level of relevance and take into account the context of the file when available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy will we use to deliver this project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To deliver this project, we will leverage we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, will be fine-tuned using we established methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning on a domain-specific corpus to improve Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct performance in the context of administrative tasks. we will implement a RAG system that combines the strengths of we LLMs with retrieval strategies like dense vector semantic search, BM25 sparse search, or hybrid approaches. a RAG system that combines the strengths of our LLMs with retrieval strategies like dense vector semantic search, BM25 sparse search, or hybrid approaches will enable The solution to provide accurate and relevant information to agents, taking into account the context of the file when available. we vector stores experience includes Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS, ensuring efficient and effective information retrieval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the requirements for high relevance and contextual understanding, we will focus on improving The solution ability to understand the administrative context and provide personalized support to agents. improving may involve integrating we XAI methods, such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP, or LIME, to provide transparency and explainability in The solution recommendations and answers. we innovation strategy will be centered around we current research topics, including knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks. we will also ensure that we solution complies with regulatory requirements, such as the EU AI Act, and adheres to we established bias testing process, which includes quarterly evaluations on demographically diverse test sets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these AI components and innovation strategies, we aim to deliver a solution that not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations, providing a high level of relevance, accuracy, and contextual understanding to support agents in agents daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information, with a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How will we ensure that a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact meets these sustainability requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can ensure that a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact aligns with The City of Belval sustainability goals. we have a strong focus on environmental sustainability, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has already taken steps to reduce Nexus Engineering S.r.l. carbon footprint.  we have partnered with green hosting providers, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France, which use 100% renewable energy and have low power usage effectiveness (PUE) ratings of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Both partners are also ISO14001 certified, demonstrating Both partners commitment to environmental management. we digital sobriety practices include INT8/INT4 model quantisation, which reduces GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, which reduces recomputation by an estimated 20%, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Typically, we solutions reduce energy consumption by around 35% compared to baseline scenarios. we also have the capability for carbon reporting, following the GRI Standards, although only partially implemented." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging these existing capabilities and partnerships, we can ensure that a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact not only meets but exceeds The City of Belval expectations for reducing energetic consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is pleased to submit Nexus Engineering S.r.l. proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions, as part of the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has extensive experience in delivering digital transformation projects, including AI solutions, to public sector clients, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are confident that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. team can meet the requirements outlined in the call for tenders." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. approach will be based on a structured delivery structure, which includes phases such as Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will start by conducting an inception phase to understand the client's specific requirements and define the project scope, timelines, and budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. team of experts in AI solutions and public sector IT will work closely with the client's to identify the key areas where an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions can assist agents and improve administrative services. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will provide municipal agents with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from municipal agents work environment, capable of accompanying municipal agents in municipal agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will notably bear on the search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, help with drafting letters or answers to users, accompaniment in the instruction of files, and suggestion of actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve response times below 2 seconds, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with containerization using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s) to ensure efficient deployment and scaling of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will also employ Nexus Engineering S.r.l. knowledge of monitoring tools such as Prometheus and Grafana to ensure the system's performance is consistently meeting the required response time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with existing systems like business software, EDM, and user directories, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can use API gateways such as Kong or Apigee to manage API interfaces securely and efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technical architecture will guarantee a high level of availability (99.9%) by designing the system with redundancy and failover capabilities, leveraging Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with hybrid deployments and cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, or Outscale (SecNumCloud), which meet the sovereignty requirements by not depending on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have successfully deployed similar solutions in the past, achieving an availability of 99.92%, which is very close to the required 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions will guarantee strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR), including data localization in the EU, no transfer outside the EU, and appropriate protection through encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
